{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18088","headline":"赠别元十八协律六首 六 · 韩愈","name":"赠别元十八协律六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寄书龙城守，君骥何时秣。\n峡山逢飓风，雷电助撞捽。\n乘潮簸扶胥，近岸指一发。\n两岩虽云牢，水石互飞发。\n屯门虽云高，亦映波浪没。\n余罪不足惜，子生未宜忽。\n胡爲不忍别，感谢情至骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}